while that relationship continues. Mere unrelated use of the same hosting
provider, employment elsewhere or personal acquaintance is not by itself control
or agency.

Excluded Parties have no authorization under this license to copy, modify,
distribute, deploy, host, integrate or operate the covered code, nor to use it to
provide route computation or another service for an excluded project. Other
